WEBVTT

02:23.440 --> 02:23.920
Hello?

02:24.840 --> 02:25.800
[Qing Ye, it's me.]

02:26.640 --> 02:28.280
[Mom said you had dinner with her.]

02:28.600 --> 02:29.400
[You're back in Beijing?]

02:30.600 --> 02:31.200
Yeah, back.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.200
[Congrats.]

02:33.280 --> 02:34.400
[You're back to normal life.]

02:36.400 --> 02:37.000
Thanks.

02:38.440 --> 02:40.120
[You don't sound too happy.]

02:40.840 --> 02:41.360
Do I?

02:42.360 --> 02:43.040
Maybe,

02:43.720 --> 02:45.200
I'm still getting used to it.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.200
[No way.]

02:47.960 --> 02:48.640
Yeah.

02:48.800 --> 02:50.800
Zhazhating has fewer skyscrapers,

02:52.200 --> 02:53.640
the lights aren't as bright,

02:54.760 --> 02:56.280
and the air always carries

02:56.280 --> 02:57.120
a hint of the sea.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.400
By all rights,

03:01.120 --> 03:03.000
I should be happy to be back.

03:05.000 --> 03:05.920
But…

03:07.000 --> 03:08.320
[But you miss that place.]

03:15.080 --> 03:15.800
You're right.

03:39.400 --> 03:40.160
Wu,

03:40.520 --> 03:41.400
dinner's ready.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.360
Come eat.

04:16.360 --> 04:17.959
[Hurry up, we're late.]

04:18.200 --> 04:19.440
[Coming!]

04:23.720 --> 04:24.760
[I haven't done my hair!]

04:25.200 --> 04:26.520
[Three minutes till late.]

04:26.840 --> 04:27.920
[Late means time-out.]

04:29.440 --> 04:30.000
[Alright.]

04:30.080 --> 04:30.680
[Move.]

05:00.200 --> 05:01.920
I've been running around lately,

05:02.920 --> 05:04.280
didn't really get to

05:04.760 --> 05:05.960
look after Ye.

05:06.400 --> 05:07.760
She didn't even get

05:08.560 --> 05:10.440
her favorite red bean zongzi.

05:11.280 --> 05:12.200
I thought

05:12.200 --> 05:13.920
she'd stay through Lantern Festival.

05:15.120 --> 05:16.960
Didn't expect her to leave in such a rush.

05:23.320 --> 05:24.760
What are you all

05:24.760 --> 05:25.640
so down about?

05:26.080 --> 05:26.760
Ye

05:27.360 --> 05:28.240
just left

05:28.240 --> 05:29.720
our little dump,

05:30.040 --> 05:31.760
she's back

05:31.760 --> 05:32.960
in her rich nest.

05:33.120 --> 05:33.960
That's a good thing.

05:34.040 --> 05:35.280
What's there to mope about?

05:39.040 --> 05:39.640
Good thing.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.080
Yeah.

05:42.520 --> 05:43.280
I just feel

05:43.280 --> 05:44.680
the house is missing someone.

05:45.280 --> 05:47.040
Feels empty now.

05:48.240 --> 05:48.960
People come

05:49.360 --> 05:50.440
and people go.

05:51.240 --> 05:52.600
Just like the seasons.

05:53.440 --> 05:54.880
Spring sunshine and blossoms,

05:55.120 --> 05:55.720
so wonderful.

05:56.320 --> 05:57.640
But it doesn't last.

05:58.280 --> 06:00.040
We also have hot summers and cold winters.

06:00.520 --> 06:02.520
Can't live missing spring forever

06:02.520 --> 06:03.840
and forget the rest.

06:05.520 --> 06:06.200
So,

06:06.720 --> 06:08.040
just live your life well now,

06:08.320 --> 06:09.800
spring will come again.

06:10.440 --> 06:11.120
The ones who leave,

06:11.680 --> 06:12.520
you'll see them again.

06:14.080 --> 06:14.520
Eat up.

06:29.600 --> 06:30.560
Finally home.

06:31.520 --> 06:32.560
Everything's cleaned up.

06:32.880 --> 06:34.200
The old nanny's back too.

06:34.400 --> 06:35.960
Need anything, just ask her.

06:36.080 --> 06:37.120
Okay, thanks, Mr. Sun.

06:38.760 --> 06:39.640
Ye, you're back.

06:39.720 --> 06:40.440
Welcome home!

06:40.720 --> 06:41.560
Come in!

06:41.840 --> 06:42.920
Long time no see, ma'am.

06:43.000 --> 06:43.440
Come in.

06:46.680 --> 06:47.080
Alright.

06:47.600 --> 06:48.360
Enough.

06:49.320 --> 06:49.960
Careful, it's hot.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.320
Call me when you're done.

06:51.440 --> 06:52.040
Okay.

07:20.960 --> 07:21.800
[Is this still alive?]

07:21.800 --> 07:22.280
[Come take a look.]

07:23.840 --> 07:24.520
[It is!]

07:24.720 --> 07:25.720
[The welwitschia made it!]

07:29.120 --> 07:29.520
Mom.

07:30.160 --> 07:30.880
Take this.

07:31.440 --> 07:32.159
What's this?

07:32.920 --> 07:34.159
My pay from lately.

07:34.600 --> 07:35.040
Not much.

07:35.320 --> 07:36.440
Give it to Auntie Shanxi

07:36.600 --> 07:37.560
for rent.

07:38.080 --> 07:38.840
I've got money.

07:39.120 --> 07:40.120
Keep it.

07:40.520 --> 07:41.840
School's starting soon.

07:41.840 --> 07:43.120
Then college after that.

07:43.880 --> 07:44.640
Save the money up.

07:44.960 --> 07:45.800
Where'd you get money?

07:46.680 --> 07:47.920
When Qing Ye's dad left,

07:48.040 --> 07:49.120
he lent me some money.

07:49.720 --> 07:50.280
A hundred grand.

07:50.600 --> 07:51.080
A hundred…

07:51.400 --> 07:52.680
I know what you're thinking.

07:52.920 --> 07:54.240
But it's not like that.

07:54.600 --> 07:55.280
Don't worry.

07:55.560 --> 07:56.640
I didn't squeeze him for it.

07:56.960 --> 07:57.720
And I'm not

07:57.720 --> 07:58.680
some money-grubber either.

07:59.960 --> 08:00.560
This money,

08:00.880 --> 08:02.080
he offered it himself.

08:02.560 --> 08:03.520
He didn't ask for it back,

08:03.520 --> 08:04.400
but I wouldn't agree.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.360
It's all in writing,

08:06.560 --> 08:07.680
clear as day.

08:07.880 --> 08:09.520
No matter how long it takes,
I'll pay it back

08:10.160 --> 08:10.720
Don't worry.

08:12.520 --> 08:13.080
So…

08:13.760 --> 08:14.720
Does Qing Ye know?

08:17.840 --> 08:18.800
I think so.

08:19.560 --> 08:20.680
Probably she was the one

08:21.080 --> 08:23.080
who asked her dad to give the money.

08:26.520 --> 08:27.680
Look at them,

08:28.600 --> 08:29.760
a hundred grand,

08:29.760 --> 08:31.240
and no sweat to them.

08:32.559 --> 08:34.039
If it were us two,

08:34.640 --> 08:36.120
who knows how long we'd have to save?

08:37.440 --> 08:38.320
Worlds apart.

08:41.520 --> 08:42.520
Keep it safe.

08:43.240 --> 08:44.159
Money doesn't come easy.

08:53.840 --> 08:54.360
Ye,

08:55.000 --> 08:56.280
your dad headed back to work.

08:57.120 --> 08:58.720
Tons waiting on him.

08:59.400 --> 09:00.080
School starts tomorrow,

09:00.240 --> 09:01.840
I'll take you in the morning.

09:02.280 --> 09:03.000
Get some rest.

09:03.120 --> 09:03.760
- I'm off.
- Okay.

09:04.080 --> 09:04.800
Bye, Mr. Sun.

09:31.920 --> 09:32.560
Mom,

09:34.200 --> 09:35.120
I'm home.

11:56.240 --> 11:56.920
Gaokao's only

11:57.160 --> 11:58.440
one semester away.

11:58.720 --> 12:00.400
We're heading

12:00.400 --> 12:01.720
into the final sprint.

12:02.520 --> 12:03.440
I hope everyone

12:03.600 --> 12:04.760
gives it everything

12:05.120 --> 12:05.680
and fights

12:06.280 --> 12:07.600
for the best future you can get.

12:09.920 --> 12:10.360
Class starts.

12:46.520 --> 12:47.920
Mom, how's the color?

12:48.360 --> 12:48.840
Sir,

12:49.440 --> 12:49.880
thanks for the hard work,

12:49.880 --> 12:50.640
have some water.

12:51.000 --> 12:51.440
Here.

12:52.560 --> 12:53.040
Sir,

12:53.520 --> 12:54.920
have some water.

12:57.760 --> 12:58.200
Grandma.

12:58.720 --> 12:59.280
Sir,

12:59.600 --> 13:00.520
have some water.

13:01.240 --> 13:01.800
Thanks.

13:03.680 --> 13:04.240
Sir,

13:04.600 --> 13:05.560
here, grab a bottle.

13:06.120 --> 13:06.640
Thanks.

13:07.160 --> 13:07.640
Have some water.

13:08.000 --> 13:08.560
Thanks.

13:30.400 --> 13:31.560
[It's alive, it's Welwitschia.]

13:32.000 --> 13:33.600
[Tough as nails.]

13:33.920 --> 13:34.800
[It can survive in the desert]

13:34.800 --> 13:35.840
[for ages and ages.]

15:04.120 --> 15:04.640
Class,

15:04.840 --> 15:05.680
I've handed out

15:05.680 --> 15:06.800
my 20 key

15:06.800 --> 15:07.840
scoring tricks.

15:07.920 --> 15:09.400
Memorize the steps.

15:09.640 --> 15:10.160
From now on,

15:10.560 --> 15:11.840
if you get a similar question

15:11.840 --> 15:12.400
and don't know how to solve it,

15:12.560 --> 15:13.800
just plug in the steps.

15:14.160 --> 15:14.680
Remember,

15:15.240 --> 15:15.760
Math

15:15.800 --> 15:17.280
can be memorized by rote learning too.

15:17.800 --> 15:19.720
If you're unsure in the exam,

15:20.080 --> 15:21.000
don't leave it blank,

15:21.200 --> 15:22.520
write whatever you can!

15:22.760 --> 15:23.520
For English,

15:23.600 --> 15:25.680
review vocab and grammar.

15:26.280 --> 15:27.520
Cram as much as you can.

15:27.840 --> 15:29.800
Don't leave either essay blank.

15:30.120 --> 15:31.120
Memorize some stock phrases

15:31.240 --> 15:32.760
and hit the word count.

15:33.280 --> 15:34.320
Get studying.

15:34.520 --> 15:36.680
Last-minute cramming still helps.

15:36.880 --> 15:38.480
Every point counts!

15:43.160 --> 15:43.920
The last holiday

15:44.360 --> 15:45.440
before the final showdown.

15:46.040 --> 15:46.760
You've got three days.

15:47.600 --> 15:48.520
I hope everyone

15:49.200 --> 15:50.320
gets good rest

15:50.960 --> 15:51.880
and resets their mindset.

15:52.640 --> 15:53.320
But,

15:53.800 --> 15:55.320
don't relax too much.

15:55.640 --> 15:57.920
We've worked hard for three years,

15:58.520 --> 15:59.560
I hope everyone

16:00.040 --> 16:01.320
leaves no regrets.

16:02.520 --> 16:03.760
Go all in for the exams.

16:04.040 --> 16:05.720
Go to the city you want

16:06.200 --> 16:08.120
and get into the university you want.

16:08.800 --> 16:09.360
Keep it up.

16:10.280 --> 16:15.280
- Keep it up!
- Keep it up!

16:18.280 --> 16:19.160
Where do you want to go?

16:19.840 --> 16:22.800
I just want the provincial
normal university,

16:23.680 --> 16:24.400
close to home.

16:30.000 --> 16:31.000
Wu, what about you?

16:47.960 --> 16:48.520
Beijing.

17:10.640 --> 17:11.280
Son,

17:13.240 --> 17:14.440
tell your grandma dinner's ready.

17:15.119 --> 17:16.319
One more dish and it's done.

17:19.079 --> 17:20.240
My boy's great.

17:21.599 --> 17:23.200
I love the way you're now!

17:23.319 --> 17:24.640
So focused.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.680
Look at you now,

17:28.040 --> 17:29.760
like those ancient scholars

17:29.960 --> 17:31.680
studying for official exams.

17:32.280 --> 17:32.960
Like

17:33.200 --> 17:35.440
"Burning the midnight oil to the extreme."

17:35.720 --> 17:36.640
Is that how it goes?

17:37.720 --> 17:39.040
Yes.

17:40.160 --> 17:40.600
Alright.

17:40.840 --> 17:41.520
Then study hard

17:41.520 --> 17:42.360
and call your grandma for dinner later.

17:42.600 --> 17:43.160
Take a break.

17:43.720 --> 17:44.160
Okay.

17:52.560 --> 17:53.120
Grandma.

18:00.440 --> 18:01.040
Grandma.

18:05.520 --> 18:06.040
Grandma.

18:06.880 --> 18:07.360
Grandma?

18:09.240 --> 18:09.880
Dinner's ready.

18:13.320 --> 18:14.000
Wu,

18:15.400 --> 18:16.960
I don't wanna eat.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.000
No.

18:18.600 --> 18:19.680
You haven't eaten all day.

18:20.000 --> 18:20.520
Come,

18:21.360 --> 18:22.040
I'll carry you downstairs.

18:29.440 --> 18:29.920
Come.

18:31.840 --> 18:32.320
Alright.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.200
Thanks, sweetheart.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.760
I'm no lightweight.

18:39.880 --> 18:40.840
You're lighter than a kitten.

18:41.320 --> 18:42.000
Time to eat!

18:46.800 --> 18:47.880
Grandma, have some soup.

18:50.120 --> 18:50.560
Mom,

18:51.040 --> 18:51.920
with how hard

18:51.920 --> 18:53.520
Wu's studying now,

18:54.120 --> 18:55.240
a top university

18:55.240 --> 18:56.160
is a sure thing.

18:56.520 --> 18:57.320
I'm telling you,

18:57.520 --> 18:58.400
our ancestors

18:58.400 --> 18:59.640
would be smiling down on us.

19:02.000 --> 19:04.560
Then the biggest credit goes to Ye.

19:04.920 --> 19:06.960
She got Wu back to school.

19:07.320 --> 19:07.720
Yes,

19:08.240 --> 19:09.160
Grandma is right.

19:09.680 --> 19:10.520
But we still need

19:10.520 --> 19:11.200
to stay calm.

19:11.680 --> 19:13.400
For the gaokao I can only do my best.

19:14.040 --> 19:15.520
Don't think about top universities.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.440
I don't agree.

19:17.600 --> 19:18.800
Why can't we aim high?

19:19.320 --> 19:19.800
Well,

19:20.040 --> 19:21.280
you have to dare to dream.

19:21.400 --> 19:23.360
Hope gives you motivation.

19:24.800 --> 19:26.000
Your mom's right.

19:27.520 --> 19:29.640
I really believe in my grandson.

19:31.280 --> 19:31.760
Come,

19:32.240 --> 19:33.360
have an egg

19:33.520 --> 19:34.360
and get full marks.

19:35.360 --> 19:36.040
Thanks, Grandma.

19:41.240 --> 19:42.240
Grandma, let me.

19:43.720 --> 19:44.360
Full marks.

19:45.320 --> 19:45.680
Mom,

19:45.880 --> 19:47.120
you should have an egg too.

19:47.320 --> 19:48.360
Stay 100% healthy!

19:48.680 --> 19:49.520
Okay.

19:52.360 --> 19:53.640
Here's some more good news.

19:54.240 --> 19:55.200
Our Xuan Island salon

19:55.640 --> 19:58.240
is almost finished being renovated.

19:59.320 --> 20:00.680
Once Wu's exams

20:00.960 --> 20:01.920
are over,

20:02.040 --> 20:03.400
I'll get the house sorted

20:03.720 --> 20:04.960
so we can move back home.

20:05.560 --> 20:06.080
Good.

20:06.680 --> 20:07.800
I'm also thinking of

20:07.880 --> 20:09.720
going to a better barbershop

20:09.720 --> 20:10.760
in the city

20:10.760 --> 20:11.800
to learn

20:11.880 --> 20:13.200
and sharpen

20:13.400 --> 20:14.320
my skills.

20:15.320 --> 20:16.280
In the future,

20:16.360 --> 20:18.200
things will turn around.

20:20.200 --> 20:20.600
Grandma,

20:20.760 --> 20:22.000
It'll only get better.

20:23.560 --> 20:24.280
That's great.

20:25.800 --> 20:27.760
Tomorrow's the 15th.

20:28.800 --> 20:29.760
Let's go

20:29.760 --> 20:32.200
thank the Dragon King and Mazu

20:32.920 --> 20:33.600
and honor our promises.

20:34.800 --> 20:36.960
I wanna see the sunset too.

20:38.520 --> 20:39.000
Sure.

20:39.200 --> 20:40.320
I haven't been out in a while.

20:41.080 --> 20:41.840
I'll go with you.

20:42.680 --> 20:44.440
Forecast says heavy rain tomorrow.

20:44.880 --> 20:45.600
How about

20:46.120 --> 20:47.040
we go together the day after tomorrow,

20:47.040 --> 20:47.680
once the weather clears up.

20:48.240 --> 20:48.920
- Sure.
- Let's go together.

20:49.080 --> 20:49.520
Good.

20:50.560 --> 20:51.320
It's settled then.

20:51.560 --> 20:51.960
Okay.

20:52.800 --> 20:53.240
Alright.

20:54.400 --> 20:55.440
The day after.

20:56.640 --> 20:57.960
That works too.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.400
Works too…

21:12.600 --> 21:13.240
Wu.

21:14.640 --> 21:15.280
Wu.

21:16.760 --> 21:17.640
Xing Wu!

21:21.600 --> 21:22.320
Xing Wu!

21:23.000 --> 21:23.760
Coming!

21:26.920 --> 21:27.520
Wu.

21:27.640 --> 21:28.160
What is it?

21:28.240 --> 21:29.760
Grandma won't wake up
no matter how I call.

21:29.760 --> 21:30.240
What do we do?

21:30.320 --> 21:30.760
Grandma.

21:31.320 --> 21:31.800
Grandma.

21:32.200 --> 21:32.640
Grandma.

21:38.280 --> 21:38.840
Take her to the hospital.

21:39.000 --> 21:39.520
Okay.

21:40.880 --> 21:42.080
Come on.

21:42.960 --> 21:43.640
Slow down.

22:47.400 --> 22:47.880
Doctor.

22:48.080 --> 22:49.040
How's my mom?

22:50.200 --> 22:51.280
The patient's elderly.

22:52.120 --> 22:53.400
Based on post-op indicators

22:53.600 --> 22:54.680
and her condition,

22:55.280 --> 22:56.160
her bodily functions

22:56.160 --> 22:57.080
are very weak.

22:58.040 --> 22:58.800
She can't tolerate

22:58.800 --> 22:59.920
aggressive treatment.

23:01.080 --> 23:03.080
We recommend hospice care.

23:03.800 --> 23:04.640
Prepare for the end.

23:34.680 --> 23:35.200
Mom.

23:35.680 --> 23:36.240
Grandma.

23:49.280 --> 23:49.760
I…

23:50.640 --> 23:51.920
I can't make it.

23:54.960 --> 23:55.400
I…

23:55.400 --> 23:56.640
Mom, don't take that off.

23:57.920 --> 23:58.920
It hurts so much.

23:59.560 --> 24:00.080
I…

24:00.520 --> 24:00.960
I…

24:01.880 --> 24:02.440
I…

24:02.520 --> 24:04.440
No intubation.

24:06.240 --> 24:08.200
No resuscitation.

24:14.800 --> 24:15.520
Lanfang.

24:18.360 --> 24:19.600
Guodong…

24:24.360 --> 24:25.920
Mom, you wanna see Xing Guodong?

24:31.520 --> 24:32.520
I know,

24:34.640 --> 24:36.520
he's gone.

24:45.280 --> 24:46.720
How did you know?

24:49.640 --> 24:50.760
Once

24:52.240 --> 24:56.520
you came back very late.

24:59.360 --> 25:03.880
And you were in a bad mood.

25:06.240 --> 25:07.720
I knew

25:09.280 --> 25:11.400
he was gone.

25:14.200 --> 25:15.840
[Leaving so soon?]

25:15.920 --> 25:16.840
[Yes, Mom.]

25:17.120 --> 25:18.280
[I'm going back to town for something.]

25:18.360 --> 25:19.400
[I'll be back in a couple of days.]

25:20.200 --> 25:20.600
[Alright.]

25:20.840 --> 25:22.280
[Take good care of yourself at home.]

25:22.280 --> 25:22.680
[Okay.]

25:22.760 --> 25:23.680
[Be safe.]

25:23.680 --> 25:24.280
[I will.]

25:26.760 --> 25:27.680
[I remember once]

25:28.800 --> 25:31.200
[I said I was going to town]

25:32.000 --> 25:33.640
[and shut down the salon
for a few days.]

25:36.120 --> 25:37.000
[Actually]

25:37.000 --> 25:38.920
[I got a call from the police.]

25:40.040 --> 25:41.920
[They asked me to identify a body.]

25:57.360 --> 25:59.240
[Guodong owed a lot of money.]

26:03.520 --> 26:05.840
[To escape debt,]

26:06.760 --> 26:08.040
[he hid on a ship.]

26:09.360 --> 26:10.640
[He drank,]

26:11.280 --> 26:12.080
[got drunk,]

26:13.280 --> 26:15.320
[missed a step]

26:15.840 --> 26:17.040
[and fell into the sea.]

26:35.160 --> 26:37.760
I don't blame you for hiding it from me.

26:40.760 --> 26:42.520
Guodong

26:44.360 --> 26:47.400
caused us so much trouble.

26:50.160 --> 26:51.560
He made our lives

26:51.720 --> 26:54.120
a living hell.

26:59.720 --> 27:00.560
Lanfang,

27:02.240 --> 27:02.920
Wu.

27:06.600 --> 27:07.920
Thanks to you both,

27:09.120 --> 27:10.520
all these years,

27:11.680 --> 27:14.080
I've finally had a good life.

27:18.200 --> 27:19.640
I have no regrets.

27:21.720 --> 27:22.320
Wu.

27:22.560 --> 27:23.120
Grandma.

27:25.600 --> 27:26.560
Wu,

27:30.160 --> 27:31.200
from now on,

27:32.360 --> 27:34.160
you've got to work hard.

27:35.520 --> 27:36.520
Got it?

27:37.920 --> 27:38.520
I will.

27:39.920 --> 27:40.560
I will for sure.

27:42.160 --> 27:42.800
Good.

27:58.120 --> 27:58.560
Wu.

27:58.640 --> 27:59.120
Wu.

28:03.400 --> 28:04.320
Why are you here?

28:05.120 --> 28:06.280
I told you not to come,

28:06.280 --> 28:07.400
just stay home and study.

28:07.720 --> 28:08.320
You never listen.

28:09.080 --> 28:10.080
We came to see Grandma

28:10.280 --> 28:11.000
and you too.

28:13.240 --> 28:14.200
How is Grandma?

28:17.800 --> 28:19.120
She's not very clear-minded.

28:19.520 --> 28:20.640
Awake only sometimes.

28:21.280 --> 28:21.960
Even when she wakes up,

28:21.960 --> 28:22.880
she may not recognize people.

28:28.520 --> 28:28.960
Oh right.

28:29.440 --> 28:30.520
The school issued exam passes.

28:30.920 --> 28:31.520
I brought yours.

28:32.760 --> 28:34.960
And the teachers
also gave prediction papers.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.400
Review them again

28:39.720 --> 28:40.520
before the exam.

28:48.760 --> 28:49.280
Thanks.

28:58.440 --> 28:59.000
Wu,

28:59.640 --> 29:00.280
should we

29:00.800 --> 29:01.840
tell Qing Ye about this?

29:02.520 --> 29:03.000
No.

29:04.440 --> 29:05.520
Don't tell her anything.

29:08.040 --> 29:08.600
Remember that.

29:10.200 --> 29:10.680
Alright.

30:18.720 --> 30:19.440
[Grandma!]

30:19.560 --> 30:21.080
[I found a big snail!]

30:27.520 --> 30:28.520
[So big!]

30:28.600 --> 30:30.600
[You're amazing!]

30:33.920 --> 30:35.320
[Let's look over there.]

30:35.400 --> 30:36.840
[There's some here too, yeah?]

30:53.440 --> 30:53.960
Grandma,

30:55.120 --> 30:56.560
Xuan Island's almost renovated.

30:58.080 --> 30:59.200
When you get better,

31:00.360 --> 31:01.760
we'll move into the new house.

31:03.680 --> 31:04.520
Didn't you say

31:05.320 --> 31:07.120
you wanted to thank Mazu
and the Dragon King?

31:08.360 --> 31:09.280
And the sunset.

31:10.200 --> 31:10.760
Look.

31:12.040 --> 31:12.640
The sunset.

31:14.080 --> 31:14.840
So beautiful.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.440
By then,

31:18.960 --> 31:20.720
we'll all live a happy life together.

31:23.560 --> 31:24.880
I've already lived

31:26.000 --> 31:27.640
a blessed life.

31:30.600 --> 31:31.640
Even though

31:31.680 --> 31:33.600
we're not blood-related.

31:38.440 --> 31:40.600
Having a daughter

31:40.640 --> 31:42.000
and a grandson like you,

31:44.240 --> 31:45.800
I've got no regrets.

32:16.080 --> 32:16.680
Grandma.

32:21.200 --> 32:21.880
Grandma.

34:15.199 --> 34:15.800
Grandma,

34:18.320 --> 34:19.760
I brought you to see the sea.

34:28.120 --> 34:28.800
I know

34:31.360 --> 34:32.679
I'm not your biological grandson.

34:34.719 --> 34:35.679
To everyone else here,

34:36.719 --> 34:37.719
you're just an old lady

34:37.719 --> 34:39.040
who loves crafts.

34:40.760 --> 34:41.440
But I know,

34:42.040 --> 34:43.440
when you were young,

34:44.360 --> 34:45.239
you went to school.

34:46.960 --> 34:48.679
But you had a hard life.

34:49.800 --> 34:50.800
Your husband died early,

34:51.800 --> 34:52.880
you raised

34:53.400 --> 34:54.520
Xing Guodong alone.

34:55.239 --> 34:56.199
To survive,

34:56.719 --> 34:57.520
you farmed,

34:58.440 --> 34:59.320
worked as a fisherwoman,

35:00.160 --> 35:01.520
even as a sailor.

35:02.440 --> 35:03.720
You suffered so much.

35:05.520 --> 35:07.360
Even though we're not blood-related,

35:08.200 --> 35:09.000
and you knew

35:09.840 --> 35:11.200
I'm not your real grandson.

35:12.320 --> 35:13.240
But you've always treated me

35:13.880 --> 35:15.000
better than anyone else.

35:17.120 --> 35:18.440
Since the day I can remember,

35:20.040 --> 35:20.880
I've always considered you

35:20.880 --> 35:22.040
my real grandma,

35:23.320 --> 35:24.520
my closest, dearest grandma,

35:25.440 --> 35:26.520
and my benefactor.

35:31.160 --> 35:32.840
Every time I was at my lowest,

35:33.880 --> 35:35.680
you were always by my side,

35:37.880 --> 35:39.400
pulling me back from the edge

35:40.360 --> 35:41.160
of the cliff.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.800
I remember when I was little,

35:44.800 --> 35:45.720
once

35:46.360 --> 35:47.720
I secretly bought a piece of candy.

35:48.320 --> 35:49.840
Xing Guodong kicked me away.

35:51.560 --> 35:52.680
I just cried on the ground.

35:54.680 --> 35:57.520
You helped me up

35:58.720 --> 35:59.720
and comforted me:

36:00.440 --> 36:01.320
"Wu,

36:02.520 --> 36:03.000
be good.

36:04.000 --> 36:04.720
Don't cry.

36:06.840 --> 36:07.760
Have some candy

36:09.360 --> 36:10.280
and it won't feel bitter anymore."

36:12.200 --> 36:13.640
I also remember when I

36:15.360 --> 36:16.720
got seriously ill as a child.

36:18.320 --> 36:19.080
I had to go to the hospital

36:19.080 --> 36:20.640
for injections every day.

36:22.160 --> 36:23.440
Xing Guodong thought
I was a waste of money.

36:25.800 --> 36:26.520
Only you…

36:27.520 --> 36:29.080
But you couldn't bear to take a car.

36:33.160 --> 36:34.040
So you carried me.

36:35.120 --> 36:36.160
It was more than ten kilometers

36:36.160 --> 36:37.400
to the county town every day.

36:37.760 --> 36:39.400
And you carried me there again and again.

36:40.320 --> 36:41.320
But look at you,

36:42.520 --> 36:43.240
when you were sick,

36:44.320 --> 36:45.320
you didn't want treatment.

36:45.920 --> 36:46.560
When you broke your bone,

36:47.280 --> 36:48.640
you refused to get surgery.

36:49.840 --> 36:51.360
You were old, and your legs were weak,

36:51.960 --> 36:53.280
you still wouldn't buy a wheelchair.

36:54.400 --> 36:54.800
Fine,

36:55.360 --> 36:56.400
then I'll make one for you.

36:57.160 --> 36:58.720
I used a chair and wheels

36:58.720 --> 36:59.920
to build a wheelchair for you.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.120
But when you sat in it,

37:01.120 --> 37:02.160
didn't you notice?

37:03.080 --> 37:03.800
It's nowhere

37:04.400 --> 37:06.120
near as good as a real wheelchair.

37:07.840 --> 37:08.920
Last time I bought you

37:08.920 --> 37:09.960
a new electric wheelchair.

37:10.800 --> 37:11.720
You said it was

37:12.760 --> 37:13.520
I was being careless

37:14.080 --> 37:14.800
with money.

37:16.520 --> 37:17.520
But do you know how happy you were

37:17.520 --> 37:18.520
sitting on it?

37:22.720 --> 37:23.320
At that time,

37:23.320 --> 37:24.640
I realized

37:25.240 --> 37:27.000
you always wanted
to go out and see the world.

37:30.920 --> 37:31.600
Grandma,

37:34.800 --> 37:35.760
you always said

37:38.680 --> 37:40.280
"Let's go gather shellfish."

37:42.120 --> 37:43.520
"Let's go see the sea."

37:44.440 --> 37:45.960
"Let's honor our promises."

37:47.440 --> 37:48.800
"Let's worship Mazu

37:49.160 --> 37:49.960
and the Dragon King."

37:50.280 --> 37:51.200
"Let's watch the sunset."

37:52.600 --> 37:53.560
After that,

37:59.040 --> 38:00.520
you never went out again.

38:09.160 --> 38:09.840
Grandma,

38:12.240 --> 38:13.160
in my next life,

38:16.000 --> 38:17.520
I still wanna be your grandson!

38:20.560 --> 38:21.320
In my next life,

38:23.800 --> 38:25.320
I'll still be your Wu!

38:29.680 --> 38:30.560
I promise

38:32.000 --> 38:32.880
I won't let you

38:32.880 --> 38:34.200
suffer like this again!

39:06.720 --> 39:07.240
[Nice.]

39:07.760 --> 39:08.320
[Really nice.]

39:09.200 --> 39:10.720
[After all, I made it myself.]

39:20.080 --> 39:20.520
[Come.]

39:20.720 --> 39:22.200
[Take one each.]

39:22.600 --> 39:23.280
[Grandma,]

39:23.720 --> 39:25.520
[this flower steamed bun is so pretty!]

39:25.800 --> 39:27.240
[Your Auntie and I]

39:27.560 --> 39:29.080
[went to the Sea Goddess temple]

39:29.120 --> 39:29.880
[to pray for it.]

39:30.080 --> 39:31.160
[Eat it and you'll have sharp mind]

39:31.280 --> 39:32.520
[and clear eyes,]

39:32.600 --> 39:33.520
[and get good grades.]

39:33.680 --> 39:34.200
[Thank you, Grandma.]

39:34.240 --> 39:34.920
[Thank you, Grandma.]

40:27.360 --> 40:29.360
Kids, do your best on the exam!

40:29.400 --> 40:30.880
Try to get a good score in the exams

40:30.920 --> 40:32.640
and bring honor to our Zhazhating!

40:32.880 --> 40:33.640
- Sure!
- Bring honor!

40:33.640 --> 40:34.080
Thanks, Dad.

40:34.080 --> 40:35.040
Don't be nervous.

40:35.160 --> 40:36.440
Stay calm.

40:36.520 --> 40:37.600
Don't stress.

40:37.720 --> 40:38.800
Show your real ability.

40:38.800 --> 40:39.240
Exactly!

40:39.520 --> 40:40.440
Believe in yourselves!

40:40.640 --> 40:41.400
What does this mean?

40:41.440 --> 40:43.200
Mom, what's this for?

40:43.440 --> 40:45.080
"Go for gold" charm!

40:46.200 --> 40:46.800
Right!

40:46.960 --> 40:48.520
Life should have a little ritual.

40:48.680 --> 40:50.680
We even wore cheongsams today.

40:50.880 --> 40:54.000
- Cheongsam's on, luck is on!
- Cheongsam's on, luck is on!

40:54.640 --> 40:55.840
It's the kids' exam day.

40:55.840 --> 40:57.280
Why are you so excited?

40:57.280 --> 40:58.200
I'm nervous!

40:58.200 --> 40:59.200
Can't you tell?

40:59.240 --> 40:59.920
Nervous?

41:00.040 --> 41:00.680
Don't be!

41:00.920 --> 41:01.400
Son,

41:01.920 --> 41:02.680
listen up.

41:02.960 --> 41:03.920
Just take the exam casually.

41:04.120 --> 41:05.120
We don't expect

41:05.160 --> 41:05.960
that much from you.

41:06.840 --> 41:08.640
Maybe I'll be the dark horse!

41:09.360 --> 41:10.400
I'll give it my all.

41:10.440 --> 41:11.000
Listen,

41:11.000 --> 41:12.000
just do your best.

41:13.040 --> 41:13.640
The bus is here.

41:14.120 --> 41:14.720
Come!

41:14.800 --> 41:16.280
Come!

41:16.440 --> 41:19.560
Good luck!

41:20.560 --> 41:22.040
Don't take "just casually" literally!

41:22.080 --> 41:22.520
Do your best!

41:22.520 --> 41:23.280
Really, it's fine!

41:23.280 --> 41:23.760
Take your time!

41:23.760 --> 41:24.920
Make us proud!

41:25.120 --> 41:25.960
Good luck, Wu!

41:26.360 --> 41:26.800
Good luck!

41:31.800 --> 41:32.960
Good luck!

41:33.640 --> 41:34.240
Good luck!

41:34.240 --> 41:35.960
Good luck!

42:13.160 --> 42:14.680
Exams are over!

43:10.800 --> 43:11.400
Ye.

43:11.960 --> 43:12.520
Dad.

43:14.080 --> 43:15.560
How's the study-abroad

43:15.560 --> 43:16.680
application going?

43:20.280 --> 43:21.320
Once it's ready,

43:21.320 --> 43:22.680
send it to the agency right away

43:22.800 --> 43:23.520
and let them handle it.

43:24.800 --> 43:25.320
Dad.

43:30.280 --> 43:31.320
There's something

43:31.320 --> 43:32.000
I want to talk to you about.

43:32.600 --> 43:33.320
What is it?

43:34.360 --> 43:35.160
I think

43:36.520 --> 43:38.240
I might be okay with not studying abroad.
